":"If it's muscles you need, just leave it to me. This is Ooshima Shizuku—yeah, I'm speaking Kansai, so cut me some slack~"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"力関係なら、私に任せて。どんなもんでもぶっ壊すで～","en":"When it comes to power dynamics, leave it to me. I'll smash anything."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"まだまだふうまには追い付かれへんけど、私だってやるんやから","en":"I still can't keep up with Fuuma, but I'll give it my all."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"あの子もあの子も、なんでみんな胸が大きいねん。くそ～、負けた～！","en":"Everyone's got huge chests—why is that? Damn, I'm defeated!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"私のウチ来てぇーなふうま。一緒にあそぼうや！","en":"Come over to my place, Fuuma. Let's play together!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"走りなら誰にも負けへんで～。次は誰が私の相手するん？","en":"If it's running, I won't lose to anyone. Who's next to take me on?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"今日の訓練も元気にこなすでー！　私にかかれば厳しい訓練も楽しくなるんやから","en":"I'll tackle today's training with energy! If I'm in charge, even tough drills become fun."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"体を動かす事ってなんて素敵なんやろう。隣町まで競争やー","en":"Moving your body is just wonderful. Race me to the next town!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/uni00032_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00032_1/u